    "text": "こがたんのバックに銭湯が見えたね\r\n腰に手を当ててコーヒー牛乳をグビグビ行く感じが見えた",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700301/3007003010390"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007003010400,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……それって、うちの演技は見てる人に\r\n背景を想像させるほどってことばい！？",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700301/3007003010400"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007003010410,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あれっ、そっちに行くの！？\r\nこがたんめっちゃポジティブだな",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700301/3007003010410"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007003010420,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "こんだけの演技力があれば……\r\nうち、女優としても活躍する日も近かね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700301/3007003010420"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007003010430,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "うーんと、まずは三峰たちとアイドルとして頑張ろっか",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700301/3007003010430"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007003010440,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "もちろん！　それは当然たい！\r\nうちらがトップアイドルになった先の話ばい！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700301/3007003010440"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007003010450,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あはは、そっか当然か\r\nこがたんはすごいね、ずっと全力だ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700301/3007003010450"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007003010460,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "それも当たり前たい！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700301/3007003010460"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007003010470,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ユニットの活動が始まってから、うちずーっと楽しか！\r\nだからこそ、うちも頑張れるたい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700301/3007003010470"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007003010480,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そっかぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700301/3007003010480"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3007003010490,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "（この子は真っ直ぐなんだなぁ……\r\n好きなものに対して、一直線なんだ）",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/300700301/3007003010490"
  },
  {
