      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3007003010630,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……そりゃあ、憧れのアイドル目指してるんだから、\r\n多少はねぇ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 310,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 1
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/300700301/3007003010630"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007003010640,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "それはそうたい！　他の３人も同じね！\r\nみーんな、楽しそうにしとるけん",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700301/3007003010640"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007003010650,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "だからうち、この５人なら\r\nきっとすごかアイドルになれるって思うとる",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700301/3007003010650"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007003010660,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……うん\r\n三峰も、みんなとならきっとできるって思ってるよ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700301/3007003010660"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007003010670,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "やけん、もっともっと頑張らなきゃいかんばい！\r\n結華にも力を貸してもらいたか！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300700301/3007003010670"
  },
  {
    "id": 3007003010680,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "よろしく頼むとよ、結華！",
